---
import "../css/reset.css";
import "../css/global.css";
import "../css/index.css";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Affordable small business websites starting at $150/month with zero down. Custom web development and technical consulting from an experienced software engineer."
    />
    <title>Starburst Digital</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <h1>Starburst Digital</h1>
      <nav>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
          <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="flow">
      <h1>Get Your Small Business Online for $150/Month</h1>
      <p>
        I build custom websites that help small businesses compete online
        without breaking the bank. No huge upfront costs. No cookie-cutter
        templates. Just a professional web presence you can afford and actually
        use.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="/contact">Get started today</a>
      </p>

      <article class="flow region">
        <h2>Why Work With Me?</h2>
        <ul class="flow">
          <li>
            <strong>Human Expertise:</strong> I'm a real software engineer with real
            experience—not a template factory or AI content mill. Every line of code
            is written with your business in mind.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Performance Optimization:</strong> Fast-loading, efficient websites
            that rank well in search engines and keep visitors engaged. I build for
            speed and results.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Internationalization Support:</strong> Need to reach customers
            in multiple languages? I can build your site to support global markets
            from day one.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="flow region">
        <h2>Experience You Can Trust</h2>
        <p>
          I've spent years building software that people depend on—from
          mission-critical systems used by first responders to real estate
          management platforms and marketing analytics tools. I bring that same
          level of reliability and attention to detail to every small business
          website I create.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="flow region">
        <h2>Services</h2>
        <div class="grid" data-layout="50-50">
          <div class="flow card">
            <h3>Small Business Websites</h3>
            <p>
              A professional website designed specifically for your business. No
              templates, no bloat—just clean, fast, and effective web design
              that helps you get found and get customers.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>Pricing:</strong> $150/month with zero down payment. Pay as
              you grow.
            </p>
            <p><strong>What's Included:</strong></p>
            <ul class="flow" data-flow="sm">
              <li>Custom branded website design</li>
              <li>Domain name management</li>
              <li>Responsive mobile-friendly design</li>
              <li>Content management system</li>
              <li>Basic SEO optimization</li>
              <li>Hosting and maintenance</li>
              <li>Regular updates and security patches</li>
              <li>Translation services (available for an additional fee)</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="flow card">
            <h3>Technical Consulting</h3>
            <p>
              Need strategic guidance on a technical decision? Platform
              evaluation? Code review? I offer hourly and project-based
              consulting to help you make smart choices without hiring
              full-time.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>Pricing:</strong> Starting at $120/hour. Weekly and Project
              rates available.
            </p>
            <p><strong>What's Included:</strong></p>
            <ul class="flow" data-flow="sm">
              <li>Full access to my expertise and experience</li>
              <li>Strategic planning and recommendations</li>
              <li>Technology and platform guidance</li>
              <li>Ongoing support and advice</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="flow region">
        <h2>Ready to Get Started?</h2>
        <p>
          Let's talk about your project. I'll give you straight answers, honest
          timelines, and a plan that actually fits your budget.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="/contact">Contact me today</a>
        </p>
      </article>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
